    summary: "This session reviews the first half of the course on Christian apologetics. It draws together 1 Peter 3:15, 2 Timothy 2:24-26, Isaiah 1:18, Hebrews 11:1, Psalm 19:1, Romans 2:15, Romans 8:18, 2 Timothy 3:16, John 1:14, 1 Corinthians 15:3-4, Psalm 111:2 and John 14:6. Learners take a mid-course test, discuss what they have learned and set goals for the second half.",
    scripture: ["1 Peter 3:15", "1 Corinthians 15:3-8"], more: ["John 14:6", "Hebrews 11:1", "Psalm 19:1"], memory: "1 Peter 3:15",
