    sa: ["Summarise the main foundations of Christian apologetics.", ["gentleness", "reasons", "creation", "conscience", "bible", "resurrection"], "A good answer says apologetics gives reasons for hope with gentleness, uses evidence from creation, conscience, Scripture, Jesus and his resurrection, answers objections such as evil, science and other religions, and depends on the Spirit."],
